==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Vernacular form of {{etyl|la|fi}} {{term|Adrianus|lang=la}}, cognate to English [[Adrian]]. It has also been used as a nickname for {{term|Aaron|lang=fi}}, {{term|Aarne|lang=fi}} and {{term|Aarre|lang=fi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈɑri]}}
* {{rhymes|ɑri|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|A|ri|lang=fi}}

===Proper noun===
{{fi-proper noun}}

# {{given name|male|lang=fi}}.

